{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luzhanqi</strong> (also known as &quot;<strong>Land Battle Chess</strong>&quot;) is a classic Chinese abstract-strategy game. It combines elements of hidden information, deception, as well as tactical maneuvering. Two players command an army whose ranks are hidden from their opponent. Both players must position their army strategically and use careful deduction to defeat their rival. And the overall goal? To capture the enemy's flag while protecting your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485740/extras/44a647a595e146091e9609094a938006.avif?t=1769050833\" width=720 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic Game in a Digital Format</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital adaptation allows you to experience Luzhanqi in a more accessible format. Regardless of whether or not you are a strategist, a board game enthusiast, or a newcomer who wants to learn, this version of Luzhanqi is a perfect introduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485740/extras/31989b0410cbf3e7aee3154873acf502.avif?t=1769050833\" width=720 height=72 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Online, Local, or Solo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a computer opponent with an adjustable difficulty level, or play against human players online. If you prefer, you can even play in a local match in-person or remotely with your friends. The game rules can be adjusted to your likings in each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485740/extras/2d991717cb243f2458fc57c7cc1f3754.avif?t=1769050833\" width=720 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the Battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luzhanqi is a game of strategy and mind games, but it doesn't require fast reflexes. Rather, it requires  careful planning, deception, and tactics. With clean pixel graphics, smooth gameplay, and a simple interface, this adaptation allows for the authentic Luzhanqi experience without the need for a referee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485740/extras/3dbb99f8884bd96ac0a3b63f7b95e5e4.avif?t=1769050833\" width=720 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Rules in Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player commands an army of ranked soldiers, explosives, and a flag. All pieces are placed secretly on the board, and players take turns moving their pieces one step at a time, never revealing identities even in combat. Higher-ranked pieces defeat lower-ranked ones, but explosives can destroy any piece along with themselves. Set traps, scout the battlefield, and outthink your opponent to emerge victorious!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Training Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485740/f24d577dfbdb201c18e47bcfec0e18aadd1bb388.jpg"},{"name":"Fledgling General","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485740/704dc484e5bb7ce8d89cfd03dc3e4829622f36c1.jpg"},{"name":"Field Marshall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485740/769bcb9b537c2ddf5cee0f0417e09aa0c2508afb.jpg"},{"name":"Tactical Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485740/34136c54fa3ccef2ae1d9942ce517a43b15efe73.jpg"},{"name":"Victory Is Yours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485740/f